Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:05.35,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Every company you have ever heard of… started the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:05.35,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}你聽過的每一間公司，都是這樣開始的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:10.38,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Someone stood up in front of a room, and asked them to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:10.38,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}有個人站到大家面前，請他們相信自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.75,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}This is ACE Pitch Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.75,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}這就是 ACE Pitch Day。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:21.13,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}You built something. Now you have three minutes, to make the whole room believe in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:21.13,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}你做出了一個作品。現在，你有三分鐘，讓全場相信它。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:29.27,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Everyone gets a sealed envelope of cash. How much is inside? Only you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:29.27,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}每個人都會拿到一個封好的信封。裡面有多少錢？只有你知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.85,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Listen to every pitch. Then put your money, where you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.85,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}聽完所有發表，把錢投給你相信的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.35,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Just one rule. You can't invest in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.35,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}只有一條規則：不能投給自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:44.56,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}The founder who raises the most, wins one month of Claude Team Premium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:44.56,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}募資最多的人，獨得 Claude Team Premium 一個月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.55,EN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}October fifteenth. Bring your best pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.55,ZH,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}10 月 15 日，帶上你最好的 pitch。
